+.\" ========================================================================
+.\"
+.IX Title "ELFEDIT 1"
+.TH ELFEDIT 1 2026-10-14 binutils-2.47.50 "GNU Development Tools"
+.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
