+.IP \fB\-W\fR 4
+.IX Item "-W"
+.PD 0
+.IP \fB\-\-wide\fR 4
+.IX Item "--wide"
+.PD
+Don\*(Aqt break output lines to fit into 80 columns. By default
+\&\fBreadelf\fR breaks section header and segment listing lines for
