+.Ve
+.Sp
+The Berkeley style output counts read only data in the \f(CW\*(C`text\*(C'\fR
+column, not in the \f(CW\*(C`data\*(C'\fR column, the \f(CW\*(C`dec\*(C'\fR and \f(CW\*(C`hex\*(C'\fR
