+.if n .ds AD l
+.\" ========================================================================
+.\"
+.IX Title "WINDMC 1"
+.TH WINDMC 1 2026-10-14 binutils-2.47.50 "GNU Development Tools"
+.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
